# funr2_rider.dem — pp-playtest-fun R2, strategy 4 (invention): RECOVERY
# RIDER. Doctrine (declared up front): under-provision ON PURPOSE, ride the
# breach INTO the post-grace drain, take a real scar, then fight back and
# heal — and then carry the surge TO THE WIN. The committed health_recover
# golden ends at 1200 ticks (pre-window); the rider plays the FULL arc the
# golden never showed: scar -> heal -> surge -> Run_Won. Shape = the
# health_lose/health_recover 3+1-node network (seed 4243); the fight-back is
# the proven 40 s fix; the rest is riding.
seed 4243
run 152000ms
era 3
health on
win surge 90
box on
fixture off
spawn_node residential 8 15
spawn_node router_basic 14 15
spawn_node content_host 20 15
at 100ms draw 0 1 standard
at 100ms draw 1 2 standard
# the fight-back (40 s — the health_recover timing): clear the narrows,
# second router, 2 wides per leg + the parallel path
at 40000ms demolish pipe 0
at 40000ms demolish pipe 1
at 40100ms place router_basic 24 10
at 40500ms draw 0 1 wide
at 40500ms draw 0 1 wide
at 40500ms draw 1 2 wide
at 40500ms draw 1 2 wide
at 40500ms draw 0 3 wide
at 40500ms draw 3 2 wide
capture at 50500ms
capture at 56000ms
expect hash stable
